								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >Make a little room for magic</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Spirit Gems brings an enchanted elven workshop to the bottom of your Windows desktop. Watch tiny artisans gather gems, craft treasures and trade their creations while you work, browse or play. Check in for a new heirloom, a curious visitor or a quiet journey into the woods.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5304340/extras/19ae0ddb8b79a4c067b6444de3f0b46f.poster.avif?t=1793138083" width=800 height=104 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5304340/extras/19ae0ddb8b79a4c067b6444de3f0b46f.webm?t=1793138083" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5304340/extras/19ae0ddb8b79a4c067b6444de3f0b46f.mp4?t=1793138083" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Befriend 100 delightful spirits</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin="anonymous" poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5304340/extras/93f36913a4fed2c3f4b87ca11a15c0aa.poster.avif?t=1793138083" width=800 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5304340/extras/93f36913a4fed2c3f4b87ca11a15c0aa.webm?t=1793138083" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >From moss foxes and coral axolotls to the Frostpetal Alicorn, curious companions are waiting to meet you. Decorate habitats to attract visitors, follow journal clues and fulfil their heirloom wishes to deepen your friendships. Pin up to three trusted favourites beside your artisans. Visitors stay until you greet them, so you can return when it suits you.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Craft 156 heirlooms</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5304340/extras/79891af25acc3f45bd1e516ae173e60f.poster.avif?t=1793138083" width=800 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5304340/extras/79891af25acc3f45bd1e516ae173e60f.webm?t=1793138083" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5304340/extras/79891af25acc3f45bd1e516ae173e60f.mp4?t=1793138083" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Turn rough gems into rings, crowns, spellbooks and other tiny treasures across eleven collections. Choose a design to craft, work towards its mastery and put your favourites on display. Eight gemstone collections begin your journey; three regional collections add 36 designs to discover through the Field Journal.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Make five magical gardens your own</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5304340/extras/87c06eeb97257d37d686c8e037282957.poster.avif?t=1793138083" width=800 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5304340/extras/87c06eeb97257d37d686c8e037282957.webm?t=1793138083" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5304340/extras/87c06eeb97257d37d686c8e037282957.mp4?t=1793138083" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Befriend more spirits to unlock Emerald Grove, Moonwater Lagoon, Starbough Canopy, Frostpetal Conservatory and Glowcap Grotto. Arrange friends and decorations, adjust their size and find a home for every keepsake. Each garden remembers its own layout.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Follow the Field Journal beyond the grove</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >After reaching Starcrown Canopy, discover Amberfall Wetlands, Crystalwind Terrace and Lanternroot Hollow. Complete journal pages to reveal new heirloom designs, help restore each region and earn keepsakes and portal arches. Optional Quiet Grove journeys reward a little patience: leave Heart Tree Bloom resting until your party returns to earn the challenge bonus.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Lantern Descent sends your party on a peaceful, non-combat expedition below the roots. Choose a scenic route, pause or return when you like, and collect decorations at depth milestones. Your best depth stays recorded for the next visit.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >One game, all the cosmetic collections</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Personalise your grove with seven pets, 24 additional character looks, six portal styles, six display frames and 18 furnishing alternatives. Moonlit Opal brings pearlescent workshop styles, gentle atmospheres and accessories for trusted spirit friends. These collections are included with the base game, alongside decorations and character looks earned through play.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >The downloadable 23-track MP3 soundtrack and four wallpapers are included in the installation, too.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >A little progress, at your own pace</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Upgrade your workshop, earn automation and send your elves on peaceful Forest Quests. Collect offline earnings, discover permanent blessings and renew your grove while keeping your treasured collections. Adjust the strip size, text size, lighting and motion to suit your desktop.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Settle into the taskbar strip or spend a little longer decorating a garden. Your next small discovery is waiting.</p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					Spirit Gems features artwork developed with generative AI.				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse sys_req" style="max-height: 300px;">
		<h2>System Requirements</h2>
				<div class="sysreq_contents">
